	(text "SCREF used to define MOSFET short-circuit detection threshold.\nResistor divider sets SCREF:\n(3.3V * (10 / (10+18)) = 1.18 V\nFilter capacitor shunts fast noise to ground (RC low-pass filter)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 55.372 68.58 0)
		(effects
